TITLE=E2E-64: Dashboard restructure — Analytics (value) + Accuracy (correctness), hourly rollup (#218)
BODY=Using any installation with rollup data (E2E-56/59/63 seeds), confirm /dashboard/analytics shows Activity + Impact, /dashboard/accuracy shows only the false-positive surface, /dashboard/insights 308-redirects to /dashboard/accuracy (org preserved), and the rollup fires hourly on both runtimes. Dashboard inspection, no fixture PR.
